    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "The purpose of this clinical study is to find out what happens to kidney and heart health during treatment with a medicine called semaglutide, which is given as an injection under the skin. The clinical study will also look at whether this medicine is safe for adults who have type 2 diabetes (T2D) and chronic kidney disease (CKD). This study will last for about 60 to 172 weeks."
    },
